Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.18,0:00:03.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could even win a reward!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:05.23,0:00:09.19,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,text,0,0,0,,{\fscx76\an2\pos(320,295)\fad(1,432)}The Dead's Lament Stratum
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.86,0:00:11.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're on our way, racing towards\Nthe village at breakneck speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.76,0:00:14.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Between Shimelai using his wind\Nmagic to make the wagon hover,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.00,0:00:17.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and Lammis and Director Bear\Npushing with all their might,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.58,0:00:20.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we might get there way\Nsooner than expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.38,0:00:22.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And so round two begins.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.48,0:00:25.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Struggle against me with all\Nyour might, you will not lord me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.64,0:00:28.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give your lives and\Nyour power to my cause!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.32,0:00:31.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got to get back fast and\Nstop him from getting his way!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:34.17,0:00:37.01,sign_1939_25_Reborn_as_a_Vend,title,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(1773,1)\an8\fs20}Reborn as a Vending Machine,\N{\fnTimes New Roman\c&H020222&}I {\c&H161C79&}Now {\c&H1C379A&}Wander {\c&H1D6FE2&}the {\c&H2D9CED&}Dungeon
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.82,0:00:43.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On the outside, I'm just a big metal box,\Nbut inside, I've still got a human soul!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.74,0:00:44.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In this new world of wonders,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:44.39,0:00:50.27,sign_1939_25_Reborn_as_a_Vend,title,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(1773,1)\an8\fs20}Reborn as a Vending Machine,\N{\fnTimes New Roman\c&H020222&}I {\c&H161C79&}Now {\c&H1C379A&}Wander {\c&H1D6FE2&}the {\c&H2D9CED&}Dungeon
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.00,0:00:47.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I travel to and fro on the back\Nof my super strong partner,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.04,0:00:48.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lammis!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.95,0:00:50.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The name's Boxxo. Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.18,0:00:52.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means yes, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.70,0:01:39.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.10,0:01:40.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,see
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.50,0:01:47.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.32,0:01:54.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,next
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.70,0:01:58.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,time.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:07.06,0:02:10.98,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(734,1)\fscx72\pos(472,52)}Mutual Understanding
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.86,0:02:11.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It didn't take us long at all to\Nget back to the transfer circle.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:10.98,0:02:14.94,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,text,0,0,0,,{\fscx90\an2\pos(320,295)\fad(1,432)}Clearflow Lake Stratum Hunters Association
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.28,0:02:14.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks to Lamas and Director\NBear running non-stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.98,0:02:19.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, Captain Kerioyl and the school\Ndirector went back to the Origin Stratum.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.90,0:02:25.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Director!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.56,0:02:27.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rector!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.47,0:02:28.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The trouble started while you were away.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.02,0:02:30.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.68,0:02:32.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give me all the details.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.30,0:02:33.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:33.38,0:02:36.84,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,text,0,0,0,,{\fscx88\an2\fad(1,432)\pos(372,295)}Hunters Association Employee
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.50,0:02:36.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A few days ago, a swarm of\Nmonsters came out of nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.08,0:02:41.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We tried, but we weren't able to\Nstop them from invading the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.34,0:02:45.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Most of the residents unfortunately\Ncouldn't get inside in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.28,0:02:48.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know this is difficult, but\Nyou must tell me everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.40,0:02:51.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's imperative that I hear\Neven the smallest piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.24,0:02:53.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so we know exactly where we stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.52,0:02:54.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.46,0:02:58.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We tried to activate the transfer circle,\Nbut it wouldn't work for some reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.50,0:03:01.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please tell me these aren't\Nthe only survivors. No, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.14,0:03:03.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are more upstairs in private rooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.90,0:03:07.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The mothers with very young children,\Nthe badly wounded, and more.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.66,0:03:09.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then there are the hunters, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.60,0:03:12.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have them on guard duty\Non the second floor terrace.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.18,0:03:14.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.09,0:03:15.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've done well, comrade.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.16,0:03:16.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now get some rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.30,0:03:17.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.50,0:03:18.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Director!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.41,0:03:20.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll go help with guard\Nduty on the terrace.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.30,0:03:24.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can better assess the situation\Nfrom up there too as gate guardians.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.70,0:03:25.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's our job.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.61,0:03:27.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll assist in defending the town
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.94,0:03:28.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm coming too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.96,0:03:32.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I may have old man magic, but it\Nalways comes through in a pinch
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.48,0:03:35.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch out old lady on your heels.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.48,0:03:39.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone up there is sure to need some\Nhealing I want to help you guys with defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.48,0:03:41.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No Lamas and Boxer.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.12,0:03:43.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need your help with meal distribution
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.26,0:03:48.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't seem like anybody's\Nbeen eating all that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.38,0:03:49.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.29,0:03:50.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.46,0:03:51.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, poor Lamas.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.66,0:03:55.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet she's worried sick and wants\Nto find Munami, her pal from the inn.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.66,0:03:57.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If she went in a battle with\Nthat weighing on her mind,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.00,0:04:00.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,she'd probably just mess things up.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:59.59,0:04:02.34,sign_2664_34_Megumi_Natural_W,text,0,0,0,,{\pos(195,20)\fad(500,1)}Megumi Natural Water
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.42,0:04:02.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, what's going on?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:02.34,0:04:05.34,sign_2664_34_Megumi_Natural_W,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\3c&HBCB436&\fs20}Megumi Natural Water
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.52,0:04:04.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is Boxxo doing all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.64,0:04:08.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, this water is so cold and tasty!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.28,0:04:09.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is so delicious too!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.68,0:04:10.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks so much, Boxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.14,0:04:14.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The resilience of these people\Nnever ceases to amaze me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.34,0:04:16.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Makes me want to do my\Nvending machine best!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.80,0:04:19.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, Boxo, on to the second floor!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.98,0:04:20.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, everybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.46,0:04:22.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cold drinks and hot food!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.14,0:04:24.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come and get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.76,0:04:29.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.68,0:04:31.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got food and drinks out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.60,0:04:33.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the big strong lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.82,0:04:35.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are Grandma and Grandpa with you?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:35.08,0:04:38.00,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,text,0,0,0,,{\fscx100\fsp3\an2\fad(403,432)\pos(425,302)}May
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.90,0:04:36.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.81,0:04:38.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yumite and Shimelai\Nare both safe and well.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.92,0:04:39.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.00,0:04:41.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.91,0:04:43.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.38,0:04:46.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lamas!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.32,0:04:47.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, look who I found!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.88,0:04:50.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yumite and Shimalai's\Ndaughter and granddaughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.66,0:04:51.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And they're both safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.70,0:04:52.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.66,0:04:55.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Karyos' girlfriend, the\Nexchange house gang,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.16,0:04:58.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and that domineering blonde\Ngirl, they're all safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.10,0:04:59.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, also... Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.06,0:05:03.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never been so\Nhappy to see you! Lammy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.48,0:05:05.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness! I missed you!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:08.45,0:05:15.37,sign_Arial,text (bottom row; left to right),0,0,0,,{\an7\c&H0A2143&\3c&H307FDB&\shad0\fs8\fscx95\pos(88,311)\fad(1,222)}French fries
Dialogue: 1,0:05:08.45,0:05:15.37,sign_Arial,text (top row; left to right),0,0,0,,{\an7\c&H0A2143&\3c&H307FDB&\shad0\fs8\pos(6,215)\fscx70\fad(1,222)}Grilled rice balls
Dialogue: 1,0:05:08.45,0:05:15.37,sign_Arial,text (top row; left to right),0,0,0,,{\an7\c&H0A2143&\3c&H307FDB&\shad0\fs8\fscx55\pos(87,216)\fad(1,222)}Pasta with cream sauce
Dialogue: 1,0:05:08.45,0:05:15.37,sign_Arial,text (bottom row; left to right),0,0,0,,{\an7\c&H0A2143&\3c&H307FDB&\shad0\fs8\fsp1.6\pos(5,311)\fad(1,222)}Hot dog
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.60,0:05:12.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxxo, I want to let the elderly\Nfighters know their girls are safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.64,0:05:13.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could you help me out?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.06,0:05:14.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.36,0:05:16.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay. Form change!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.88,0:05:18.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.80,0:05:20.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I appreciate you, Voxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.66,0:05:34.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, this can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.00,0:05:38.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at what those monsters have\Ndone to our precious village.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.36,0:05:41.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You and me, I'm devastated too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.92,0:05:45.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But right now, we've got\Nimportant work at hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.88,0:05:57.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who knew Shirley and\NGoat Guy were so strong?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.80,0:05:58.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A gobsmacked!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.96,0:06:01.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, old-timers!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.48,0:06:03.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your daughter and granddaughter are safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.68,0:06:06.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Karios, your girl is too! Aye!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.92,0:06:19.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Roaring Strike!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.08,0:06:25.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone's doing everything they can.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.94,0:06:27.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't let them show me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.84,0:06:29.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is everyone all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.10,0:06:30.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxer, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.48,0:06:32.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are all your parts working\Nand in the right place?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.64,0:06:33.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.56,0:06:34.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yulami, you two?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.52,0:06:37.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like Lamas is feeling better.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.50,0:06:41.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only safe place for\Nyou to rest is inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.12,0:06:44.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take care of things from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.62,0:06:46.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, it's fighting time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.24,0:06:50.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess seeing Moon in me\Nreally boosted her morale.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.92,0:06:52.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Lamas, nice to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.80,0:06:54.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, good to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.36,0:06:55.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, I love that outfit.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.22,0:06:57.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.72,0:06:59.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Had to come take a quick break.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.26,0:07:00.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.46,0:07:04.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, how did you, uh, was\Nthat your magic, Lamas?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.64,0:07:07.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nope, that was courtesy of Boxxo. Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.78,0:07:08.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxo did this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.00,0:07:10.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well then, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.84,0:07:12.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You seem like a top-notch guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.16,0:07:14.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too bad you're a magic item.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.02,0:07:15.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.93,0:07:18.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I weren't a box, I\Nmight get the wrong idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.44,0:07:19.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.35,0:07:20.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time for Boxo and me to hold the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.88,0:07:22.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You go take a long nap, okay, Shirley?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.98,0:07:25.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You always say lack of sleep\Nis the arch-enemy of beauty.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.00,0:07:28.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dang, I feel called\Nout, but I can't argue.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.28,0:07:30.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, time to slay some monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.66,0:07:41.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Incredible, Lumet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.62,0:07:45.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would love to transform into a power\Nwasher and help everyone out there,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.30,0:07:49.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I'd better keep that one in\Nmy back pocket for time's sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.32,0:07:52.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The defensive wall's been breached?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.50,0:07:54.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that how the monsters are getting in?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.78,0:08:04.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Boxxo, may I have some water?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.82,0:08:08.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lammis, are you tired\Nout already? Oh, right.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:05.67,0:08:07.46,sign_2664_34_Megumi_Natural_W,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\3c&HBCB436&\fs20\fad(357,1)}Megumi Natural Water
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.60,0:08:10.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She ran all the way home\Nwithout stopping to rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.82,0:08:12.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course she's exhausted.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.84,0:08:16.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, ready for round two.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.66,0:08:17.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All thanks to you, Boxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.88,0:08:20.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you too, Lamas. Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.14,0:08:22.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.82,0:08:23.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.08,0:08:25.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too bad, too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.80,0:08:27.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're pushing too hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.38,0:08:28.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got to rest, Lamas.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.28,0:08:30.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, Boxxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.56,0:08:32.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to keep going to save them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.80,0:08:33.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't run.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.92,0:08:35.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll fight till the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.52,0:08:36.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can protect everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.22,0:08:39.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It won't be like when I was small.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.50,0:08:40.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Lamas.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.60,0:08:45.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Long ago, our village was attacked,\Nwiped out by a horde of monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.90,0:08:50.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Few survived, but Lamas and I\Nwere among the ones who did.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.72,0:08:54.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our parents, though,\Nthey weren't so lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.56,0:08:58.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is bringing Lamas back to\Nwhen her old village was destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.20,0:09:02.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can understand the feeling, but if she\Nkeeps pushing this hard, she could die.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.90,0:09:05.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.90,0:09:07.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to stop her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.44,0:09:09.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now's my chance to try\Nwhat I've been practicing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.52,0:09:11.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No time like the present!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.28,0:09:12.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here goes nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.90,0:09:14.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lammis.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.24,0:09:17.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.06,0:09:19.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.86,0:09:22.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should maybe stay back, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.10,0:09:26.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.38,0:09:27.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bokshu!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.76,0:09:31.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you just say my name? You did!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.38,0:09:32.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't you, Boxxo?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.44,0:09:34.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When did you learn to talk?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:35.84,0:09:39.30,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,text,0,0,0,,{\fscx85\an2\fad(1,432)\pos(322,295)}Hunters Association Guest Room
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.82,0:09:38.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Llamas was so shocked that I spoke,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.90,0:09:41.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,she screamed her head off\Nand then promptly passed out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.68,0:09:45.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess that development really pushed\Nher mind and body over the edge.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.64,0:09:46.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rest up, Llamas.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.42,0:09:50.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Boxxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.74,0:09:53.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did I just hear Llamas\Nyelling what I think I did?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.38,0:09:55.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something about how you could talk? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.98,0:09:58.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, what? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.64,0:10:01.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.62,0:10:04.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, so that means what?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.96,0:10:07.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That you can talk a bit,\Njust not quite fluently?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.74,0:10:08.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.80,0:10:10.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that halting way you're speaking,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.92,0:10:14.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is it because there are limits to\Nwhat syllables you have to draw from?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.34,0:10:17.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It really is helpful that\Nshe's so quick on the uptake.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.34,0:10:19.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.40,0:10:20.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.12,0:10:23.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I look forward to serving you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.70,0:10:25.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could even win a reward.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.06,0:10:27.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.24,0:10:28.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You win.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.66,0:10:30.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please insert coins.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.34,0:10:32.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.46,0:10:34.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can take parts of\Nthe words you use in your
Dialogue: 1,0:10:33.52,0:10:39.03,sign_Arial,text (top row; left to right),0,0,0,,{\an7\shad0\bord4}wa ra ya ma ha na ta sa ka a\N ri mi hi ni chi shi ki i\N wo ru yu mu hu nu tsu su ku u\N re me he ne te se ke e\N n ro yo mo ho no to so ko o
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.64,0:10:37.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,stock phrases and create\Nnew words from them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.54,0:10:38.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.06,0:10:41.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're only saying a few sounds at a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.24,0:10:42.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that all you can manage?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.88,0:10:46.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,K-lo-s-ba-it-ni-ot-k-wo-ite.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.28,0:10:50.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I say sections of my\Ncanned phrases, it sounds fine.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:47.50,0:10:54.88,sign_Arial,text (first red),0,0,0,,{\an7\shad0\bord4\c&H7916D2&}Atari de mo su
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.74,0:10:53.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But when I string individual\Nsyllables together,
Dialogue: 1,0:10:52.04,0:10:54.88,sign_Arial,text (5th red),0,0,0,,{\an7\shad0\bord4\c&H7916D2&}chi
Dialogue: 1,0:10:52.75,0:10:54.88,sign_Arial,text (6th red),0,0,0,,{\an7\shad0\bord4\c&H7916D2&}ga\N u
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.38,0:10:56.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it always ends up sounding\Nlike an old-school robot voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.40,0:10:57.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.60,0:10:59.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or I think I do, for the most part.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.46,0:11:01.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's incredible, though, Boxxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.82,0:11:04.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you can communicate\Nmuch better than before.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.46,0:11:07.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know that Lamas is\Ngoing to be over the moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.24,0:11:10.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, I'm over the moon, too, obviously.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.34,0:11:12.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's so much to learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.10,0:11:15.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to know everything about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.54,0:11:19.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It must feel so awkward for her to\Nsay such un-Hula-me-like things.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.46,0:11:23.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,While I would love to sit and enjoy\Nthis conversation, now is not the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.18,0:11:30.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want to go back out to\Nthe terrace? You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.80,0:11:37.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't ever get tired, so I'm the\Nbest guy for tests of endurance?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.32,0:11:39.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because I'm a vending machine!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.54,0:11:44.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't stay transformed longer than\Nthe time limit, but I can still do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.14,0:11:52.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That old favorite, cola and mint candy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.52,0:11:53.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cola Bombs!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.44,0:12:05.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,how's that cola spray\Nfeels great in those big
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.04,0:12:09.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,dumb monster eyes there's\Nmore where that came from
Dialogue: 1,0:12:09.54,0:12:13.00,sign_1939_25_Reborn_as_a_Vend,text,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(189,1)\an8\fs20\pos(487,139)}Reborn as a Vending Machine,\N {\fnTimes New Roman\c&H020222&}I {\c&H161C79&}Now {\c&H1C379A&}Wander {\c&H1D6FE2&}the {\c&H2D9CED&}Dungeon
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.58,0:12:16.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,boxo apparently the monster horde\Ntypically retreats in the early
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.74,0:12:20.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,evening so they can launch a fierce\Nlate night attack that means we had to
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.46,0:12:23.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,put up a late night defense there\Nwas unanimous agreement not to ask
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.82,0:12:27.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,too much of our elderly hunters\Ndirector bear hadn't gotten any sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.12,0:12:32.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So he's zonked out on Hulumi's super\Nstrong homemade sleep medicine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.92,0:12:35.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heads up, comrades.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.40,0:12:38.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Four creatures incoming,\Nand they're moving quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.34,0:12:45.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess who's back?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.26,0:12:48.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, looks like everyone else is back, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.64,0:12:50.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Boxxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.84,0:12:53.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give us something real tasty\Nto eat right now, Boxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.50,0:12:56.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm glad to see the band of gluttons\Ndemanding food before celebrating our reunion.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.94,0:12:59.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,means they're feeling like themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.46,0:13:01.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Behold, your favorite fried chicken!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.02,0:13:03.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We looked!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.46,0:13:05.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All around!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.14,0:13:08.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Save it for when you're\Ndone eating, Mikenne.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.38,0:13:11.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where was I?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.62,0:13:15.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, right, so we ran around the village\Nlooking for survivors of the attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.48,0:13:18.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But no matter where we\Nwent, we couldn't find any.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.28,0:13:22.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And as far as the monsters, they're\Ngathered together near a big hole?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.16,0:13:23.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they made in the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.30,0:13:25.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And more and more keep showing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.30,0:13:29.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We saw several big ones way off\Nin the distance headed this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.56,0:13:33.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, these little guys were\Nrunning around in this danger zone?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.08,0:13:36.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which means it's reasonable\Nto assume we can expect the
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.18,0:13:39.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,King Frog Fiends to show up\Ntomorrow or the day after.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.80,0:13:44.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Comrades, we must focus\Non the task before us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.68,0:13:47.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And while there isn't much I can\Ndo, I swear I'll give it my all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.82,0:13:52.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With our combined strength, I know we\Ncan dispose of these Fel Fiends handily.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.10,0:13:53.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, he nailed that speech.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.70,0:13:56.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's really charming when\Nhe goes into manly mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.60,0:13:58.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, if he could just do\Nsomething about that trembling,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.06,0:14:00.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,clenched fist, he'd be golden.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.18,0:14:03.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mishuel's trying his best,\Ndespite his awkward ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.06,0:14:05.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You heard the man.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.36,0:14:06.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No taking reckless risks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.36,0:14:10.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you get hurt, get\Nback inside immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.74,0:14:12.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Reinforcement hunters and\Nthe healing squad will
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.88,0:14:15.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,be waiting right on the\Nother side of the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.64,0:14:17.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great job, apprentice.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.32,0:14:20.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now just relax and have\Na nice chocolate drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.64,0:14:22.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, uh, thanks, Master.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:22.09,0:14:24.38,sign_9881_78_Gentle_Cocoa,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(480,1)}Gentle Cocoa
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.62,0:14:23.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.78,0:14:28.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxxo, we'll protect everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.92,0:14:31.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't afford to lose anyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.20,0:14:36.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I have a plan, assuming the ecology\Nhere is anything like it is on Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.70,0:14:39.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The real question is\Nwhether she'll let me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.68,0:14:43.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, what is it, Boxxo?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:47.15,0:14:49.15,sign_2664_34_Megumi_Natural_W,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H7CA3C5&\3c&H93E4F8&\fs20}Early Afternoon Tea
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.82,0:14:53.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What, you want me to put\Nyou down there? No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.12,0:14:56.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A bunch of enemies are on\Ntheir way here right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.90,0:15:00.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I don't care!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.40,0:15:01.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's way too dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.88,0:15:03.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I refuse to let you do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.48,0:15:07.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doesn't look like anything\NI say will convince her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.60,0:15:09.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In which case...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.66,0:15:11.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, eh? Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.36,0:15:13.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How come you haven't\Nsaid my name yet, Boxo?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.08,0:15:16.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh, what, is she pouting?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.84,0:15:19.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have almost all the\Nsounds, everything but the M.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.50,0:15:23.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's fine for Lammis, but would\NHulemy sound too weird without the M?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:20.06,0:15:22.06,sign_Arial,text (left red),0,0,0,,{\an7\shad0\bord4\c&H1948D3&}ru mi hi
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.48,0:15:26.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great, I can see it on her face.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.46,0:15:28.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She knows my limitations\Nand she's testing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.68,0:15:30.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can play your game.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.00,0:15:32.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.16,0:15:33.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.68,0:15:37.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that came right\Nout of nowhere, Boxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.48,0:15:39.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't think you can weasel\Nyour way out I'm proud
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.24,0:15:41.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of saying my name with\Nsuch flagrant flattery.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.40,0:15:43.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heh, I win this round.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.46,0:15:49.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, Boxxo, are you actually\Nflirting with Hulemy? Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.66,0:15:50.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lamas is pouting?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.96,0:15:52.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is bad. Lamas?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.86,0:15:55.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like Boxo's cooked up a strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.46,0:15:57.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't we let him try it? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.74,0:15:59.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means go while I still can.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.30,0:16:01.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Hulemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.80,0:16:02.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Form change!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.02,0:16:13.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got just under\Nan hour till midnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.50,0:16:16.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I have over an hour left\Nwhere I can be transformed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.98,0:16:20.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means if I start now, I've got\Njust enough time as a different model.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.82,0:16:22.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Current point total is...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.36,0:16:23.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A hundred thousand.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.06,0:16:26.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It went way down from\Nfighting the Netherlord,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.24,0:16:28.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but now I have plenty\Nthanks to Director Bear who
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.66,0:16:31.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,inserted a bunch of gold coins\Nas advance payment earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.04,0:16:32.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Form change!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:34.68,0:16:38.10,sign_Verdana,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H724572&\3c&HC4AD93&\bord4\shad0\fs30}Ice
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.68,0:16:37.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.12,0:16:40.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, that's Voxo, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.44,0:16:46.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think you're shooting ice!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.28,0:16:47.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And look how much there is!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.92,0:16:51.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Most of the enemies are snake,\Nfrog, and crocodile monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.44,0:16:53.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On Earth, they'd be cold-blooded animals.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.54,0:16:56.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They should have trouble\Nwith extreme heat or cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.38,0:16:58.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll surround the association with ice,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.28,0:17:00.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which will lower the\Ntemperature dramatically.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.02,0:17:08.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here they come i can't\Ntell if the ice is working
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.02,0:17:11.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but now that i've up\Nto my stats i should be
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.86,0:17:14.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,able To do more with\Nthe existing ice got to
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.98,0:17:18.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,concentrate bring the ice\Ntogether and harden it
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.00,0:17:23.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Started spinning and then rocketed\Nbeyond the barrier bombs away
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.32,0:17:31.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Awesome it worked now.\NI've just got to keep
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.22,0:17:43.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no sneaking up on a vending\Nmachine with a 360-degree field of vision.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.52,0:17:46.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm taking all of you out Right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.72,0:17:51.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Boss No!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.76,0:17:53.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is Shulami talking to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.44,0:17:57.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your abilities consume money as\Ntheir primary energy source, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.22,0:17:59.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Should you really be\Nusing them so liberally?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.06,0:18:01.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you worried about?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.50,0:18:04.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Director Bear paid me ten\Ngold coins in advance!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.10,0:18:07.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the heck?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.34,0:18:08.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.56,0:18:10.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had 100,000 points left!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.68,0:18:13.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it super expensive to launch\Nthings using the barrier or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.70,0:18:15.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I honestly have no idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.36,0:18:19.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I do know I had better hightail it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.10,0:18:21.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm back!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.60,0:18:25.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How am I gonna get out of this one?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.36,0:18:29.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sit there and think\Nabout what you've done.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.86,0:18:33.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Welp, I am a vending machine, so sitting\Nhere is definitely in my wheelhouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.50,0:18:34.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I'd do it all again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.64,0:18:37.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought I told you I didn't\Nwant you to go down there!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.24,0:18:38.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would you just ignore me, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.04,0:18:41.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't get me wrong, I believe\Nin you wholeheartedly.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.56,0:18:45.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But still, if you asked me not to\Ndo something and I did it anyway...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.46,0:18:49.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At times like this, it's best to\Njust be quiet and look real sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.30,0:18:50.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.21,0:18:54.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think if you sit there quietly looking\Nreal sorry, I'll forgive and forget?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.30,0:18:55.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.60,0:18:58.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do like that she can read\Nme, but sometimes it's scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.72,0:19:02.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The way my points were draining so fast\Nin giant vending machine mode was scary,
Dialogue: 1,0:18:59.45,0:19:03.20,sign_Verdana,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H724572&\3c&HC4AD93&\bord4\shad0\fs30}Ice
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.48,0:19:03.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.39,0:19:05.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was not expecting that at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.46,0:19:07.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you even listening to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.18,0:19:09.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've had it up to here, Boxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.28,0:19:12.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know Lamas is just mad because\Nshe cares and was worried about me,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.72,0:19:15.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I hope she gets it\Nout of her system soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.18,0:19:21.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think we're safe for tonight,\Nbut tomorrow it starts again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.66,0:19:23.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know things would be\Nmuch easier if we could
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.80,0:19:26.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,do something about that\Nbreach in the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.10,0:19:32.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess all I can do right now is help\Neveryone sleep soundly by diffusing a nice,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.26,0:19:33.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,relaxing floral scent.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:41.86,0:19:43.28,sign_Verdana,text (bottom row; l->r),0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H967BA5&\3c&H531E80&\shad0\bord\fs8\move(90,230,90,360)}Chocolate & Vanilla
Dialogue: 1,0:19:41.86,0:19:43.28,sign_Verdana,text (bottom row; l->r),0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H967BA5&\3c&H531E80&\shad0\bord\fs12\move(220,230,220,360)}Milk Azuki
Dialogue: 1,0:19:41.86,0:19:43.28,sign_Verdana,text (bottom row; l->r),0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H967BA5&\3c&H531E80&\shad0\bord\fs8\move(360,230,360,360)}Matcha Azuki
Dialogue: 1,0:19:41.86,0:19:44.70,sign_Arial,text (right side),0,0,0,,{\move(500,95,500,355)\an8\c&H34798B&\3c&H152227&\fs15}Vending
Dialogue: 1,0:19:41.86,0:19:44.78,sign_Verdana,text (2nd row up; l->r),0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H967BA5&\3c&H531E80&\shad0\bord\fs8\move(90,85,90,360)}Cheesecake
Dialogue: 1,0:19:41.86,0:19:44.78,sign_Verdana,text (2nd row up; l->r),0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H967BA5&\3c&H531E80&\shad0\bord\fs8\move(235,85,235,360)}Cookies and Cream
Dialogue: 1,0:19:41.86,0:19:44.78,sign_Verdana,text (2nd row up; l->r),0,0,0,,{an8\c&H967BA5&\3c&H531E80&\shad0\bord\fs8\move(360,98,360,360)}Ganache
Dialogue: 1,0:19:42.61,0:19:45.87,sign_Verdana,text (3rd row up; l->r),0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H967BA5&\3c&H531E80&\shad0\bord\fs8\move(85,30,85,335)}Triple Chocolate
Dialogue: 1,0:19:42.61,0:19:45.87,sign_Verdana,text (3rd row up; l->r),0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H967BA5&\3c&H531E80&\shad0\bord\fs8\move(220,20,220,325)}Caramel
Dialogue: 1,0:19:42.61,0:19:45.87,sign_Verdana,text (3rd row up; l->r),0,0,0,,{an8\c&H967BA5&\3c&H531E80&\shad0\bord\fs8\move(350,30,350,330)}Matcha
Dialogue: 1,0:19:43.95,0:19:45.87,sign_Verdana,text (4th row up; l->r),0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H967BA5&\3c&H531E80&\shad0\bord\fs8\move(80,5,80,185)}Chocolate Mint
Dialogue: 1,0:19:43.95,0:19:45.87,sign_Verdana,text (4th row up; l->r),0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H967BA5&\3c&H531E80&\shad0\bord\fs12\move(220,5,215,180)}Colorful
Dialogue: 1,0:19:43.95,0:19:45.87,sign_Verdana,text (4th row up; l->r),0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H967BA5&\3c&H531E80&\shad0\bord\fs8\move(360,10,360,190)}Chocolate Chip
Dialogue: 1,0:19:43.95,0:19:45.87,sign_Verdana,text (4th row up; l->r),0,0,0,,{an8\c&H967BA5&\3c&H531E80&\shad0\bord\fs8\move(510,5,510,190)}Strawberry
Dialogue: 1,0:19:45.33,0:19:45.87,sign_Verdana,text (5th row up; l->r),0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H967BA5&\3c&H531E80&\shad0\bord\fs8\move(75,5,80,55)}Orange Sherbet
Dialogue: 1,0:19:45.33,0:19:45.87,sign_Verdana,text (5th row up; l->r),0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H967BA5&\3c&H531E80&\shad0\bord\fs8\move(360,5,360,55)}Grape Sherbet
Dialogue: 1,0:19:45.45,0:19:45.87,sign_Verdana,text (5th row up; l->r),0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H967BA5&\3c&H531E80&\shad0\bord\fs8\move(205,5,205,45)}Lamune
Dialogue: 1,0:19:45.49,0:19:45.87,sign_Verdana,text (5th row up; l->r),0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H967BA5&\3c&H531E80&\shad0\bord\fs8\move(490,5,490,45)}Vanilla
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.58,0:19:48.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This frozen treat is terrific.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.92,0:19:51.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So sweet and refreshing. You said it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.46,0:19:54.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think I've ever had anything\Nthis cold and yummy in my whole life.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.00,0:19:56.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, let's have a bite of each other's.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.90,0:19:57.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.94,0:19:59.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought you'd never ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.92,0:20:02.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought the ice cream would\Nhelp everyone beat the heat.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.58,0:20:05.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it's great to see\Nhow much they love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.88,0:20:09.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is time for the War\NCouncil to commence.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.92,0:20:13.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The first order of business is closing\Noff the gap in the protective wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.76,0:20:15.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Without that, we're\Njust chasing our tails.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.70,0:20:17.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does anyone have ideas?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.70,0:20:18.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yulami.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.98,0:20:22.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a ton of rubble at the site\Nof the breach in the wall, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.40,0:20:24.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Moving that's going to be our best option.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.98,0:20:28.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The question then becomes how\Nmany here can manipulate Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.24,0:20:29.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me think for a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.16,0:20:31.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I believe three people.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.34,0:20:33.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then there's Shimei.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.14,0:20:35.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Earth magic, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.74,0:20:38.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not my specialty, but I\Ncan still give it a go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.42,0:20:40.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can figure something out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.18,0:20:42.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just gotta summon enough\Nearth magic to cover the gap.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.74,0:20:43.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.04,0:20:47.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Couldn't Boxxo turn into that big thing\Nfrom last night and fill the hole?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.80,0:20:49.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I look forward to serving you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.58,0:20:52.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's actually not a bad idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.98,0:20:55.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The problem is that\NBoxxo uses exponentially
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.24,0:20:57.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,more money when he\Nchanges into other forms.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.80,0:20:58.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That one?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.71,0:21:00.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It takes even more than his smaller forms.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.56,0:21:03.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet something that large\Nwould require quite the sum.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.28,0:21:05.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for always having my back, Yulami.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.62,0:21:09.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to f' you coins?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.92,0:21:12.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only for a bit!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.44,0:21:15.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It means you can do it for a little while.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.70,0:21:18.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But maintaining it for a\Nlong time is more difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.36,0:21:20.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you could buy us some time at least?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.64,0:21:23.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then the rest of us can work\Nquickly to repair the breach point.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.86,0:21:27.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How much more coin does the Hunters\NAssociation have in reserve?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.58,0:21:31.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,About 60 gold as far as I\Nknow Wow, that little you say
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.44,0:21:33.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxxo,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.35,0:21:37.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,how long do you suppose you could maintain\Nthat form if we gave you 60 gold coins 60
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.74,0:21:40.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,coins that equals 60 000 points but i was
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.06,0:21:43.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,shocked at how quickly i\Nburned through them last
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.20,0:21:48.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,night director bear
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.66,0:21:52.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,suori if it's money you
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.02,0:21:55.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,need then i might have\Na brilliant idea that
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.68,0:21:59.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,could save the whole town\Nsuori have you really
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.98,0:22:02.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,got a plan to get us\Nout of this Christmas?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.10,0:23:15.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.92,0:23:36.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could even win a reward.
